flowchart TB
    U[User] --> UI[Android UI: Jetpack Compose Material 3]
    UI --> NAV[Voyager navigation and TabbedScreen]
    NAV --> VM[ViewModels and state flows]
    VM --> DOMAIN[Domain: use cases, preferences, repository contracts]
    DOMAIN --> DATA[Data: SQLDelight, OkHttp, ProtoBuf, JSON]
    VM --> EXT[ExtensionManager and SourceManager]
    EXT --> SOURCE[Installed source extensions and source-api]
    DATA --> DB[(Local database and preferences)]
    DATA --> NET[NetworkHelper and remote repositories]
    NET --> SUPA[Supabase auth, profile, social, comments]
    NET --> KEI[Keiyoushi index.pb and APK metadata]
    SOURCE --> WEBSITES[Independent manga/manhwa websites]
    TOKENS[MslTheme and MslDesignTokens] --> UI
    CORE[core/common, core/archive, core/metro, i18n, icons, presentation-core] -. shared foundations .-> UI
    CORE -. shared foundations .-> DOMAIN
    CORE -. shared foundations .-> DATA
